{"id": "cm-x-kj", "title": "考前十二句口訣", "notesHtml": "<div class=\"kgrid\"><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>1</span>危機先保命，安全再輔導。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>2</span>保密是原則，自傷通報是例外。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>3</span>個人中心三核心：真誠、同理、無條件。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>4</span>焦解找例外，敘事把問題外化。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>5</span>班級經營重預防，規則明確少而正。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>6</span>處理違規看行為，絕不否定人價值。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>7</span>自然自己來，邏輯有關聯，處罰未必能教會。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>8</span>融合不是同班待，支持到位才算愛。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>9</span>LRE 需求為本，調整改路徑、修改改目標。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>10</span>FBA 找功能，PBS 教替代，前事調整最有效。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>11</span>流程混亂用 TEACCH，社交困難用故事，想說無話用 PECS。</div></div><div class=\"kc kjonly\"><div class=\"kj\"><span>12</span>Super 彩虹看一生，Holland 六角配環境。</div></div></div>", "questions": [], "recall": []}